            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.56

- Fixed a committed swipe cover animating over itself when track metadata arrived before the swipe settled.
- Reused queue artwork when YouTube Music shortens the same track title after playback begins.
- Prevented duplicate artwork downloads and transitions for safe featured-artist title variants.
]]></description>
